{"4175060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drop 2 Win", "steam_appid": 4175060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple fast paced Dropper/Plinko hybrid where you combine skill and luck. Drop in, set high scores, gamble your score, win big, then upgrade to win bigger next time. Upgrades in the main menu can be bought using the in game currency, and are used to achieve a higher score in Dropper. The higher the score, the more in game money you can gamble away in Plinko. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple fast paced Dropper/Plinko hybrid where you combine skill and luck. Drop in, set high scores, gamble your score, win big, then upgrade to win bigger next time. Upgrades in the main menu can be bought using the in game currency, and are used to achieve a higher score in Dropper. The higher the score, the more in game money you can gamble away in Plinko. </p>", "short_description": "Drop2Win is as self explanatory as it gets; the higher the dropper score, the more money to bet with in Plinko. When a run is finished that money you won in Plinko can be used to achieve higher dropper scores through upgrades. Combine your skill and luck to achieve a new high score!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175060/f813cdfc51cf7edbb7de6d8c14eca77e701148fc/header.jpg?t=1763928830", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175060/5d1cfc1ffd8d424f6891367a874c1f3ec6f1aae6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763928830", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175060/5d1cfc1ffd8d424f6891367a874c1f3ec6f1aae6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763928830", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8.1/10 (64‑bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</str